  "08_top_liked_posts": [
    {"id": 1783, "body": "作为华人，在2026年的环境下，你会更推荐在哪个国家生活、就业或创业？\r\n\r\n如果现在可以重新选择，你会继续留在荷兰，还是会考虑搬去其他国家？为什么？", "type": "question", "is_vip": false, "section": "panel", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:42:02.075736+00:00", "like_count": 37, "author_name": "可嘉 Kejia Li", "reply_count": 2, "author_company": "McCain Foods"},
    {"id": 1769, "body": "现在AI冲击到来的时候，我们都可以被蒸馏成skill. 作为职场中的人，我们应该积累什么才能让自己未来有保障？", "type": "question", "is_vip": false, "section": "panel", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:19:15.440916+00:00", "like_count": 27, "author_name": "赵端", "reply_count": 0, "author_company": "芯片公司"},
    {"id": 1776, "body": "公司如何衡量AI支出的回报率？", "type": "question", "is_vip": false, "section": "panel", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:31:42.191651+00:00", "like_count": 27, "author_name": "Kevin Liu", "reply_count": 1, "author_company": "Nexperia"},
    {"id": 1758, "body": "提问：现在找工作，jd都要求会一定的AI。在招聘中，会AI的评判标准是什么？实际面试中，如何去给这个人的AI能力打分呢？", "type": "text", "is_vip": false, "section": "panel", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:11:12.46824+00:00", "like_count": 21, "author_name": "杰西卡", "reply_count": 0, "author_company": "失业😭"},
    {"id": 1764, "body": "但senior 是需要从junior 培养的，所以完全不用junior是不可能的？ 请问嘉宾们怎么看", "type": "question", "is_vip": false, "section": "panel", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:17:44.344042+00:00", "like_count": 21, "author_name": "FF", "reply_count": 1, "author_company": "FF Quant Advisory"},
    {"id": 1800, "body": "点赞区", "type": "text", "is_vip": false, "section": "lounge", "created_at": "2026-05-09T15:20:10.59396+00:00", "like_count": 20, "author_name": "小茗", "reply_count": 4, "author_company": "DENSO"},
